# [[architecture-property-fracture-bilateral]] — this species IS the
#   operational half; the declarative half is
#   `@epistemologic/pact/bilateral.bilateral_well_formed(decl) ∧
#   arm_shadows_decl(arm, decl)` — the predicate the compiler checks
