# [[architecture-prism-as-trait-as-everything]] — `prism
#   @kintsugi/fracture/bilateral_arm_redundant` declares the species
#   IS a prism.
# [[feedback-substrate-already-had-the-word]] (~73rd landed instance)
#   — every primitive this species composes over was already landed;
#   ZERO new mechanism.
# [[feedback-craft-not-deliver]] — action bodies (detect, collapse)
#   discharge at realisation via the reflective evaluator + the @io
#   boundary; the substrate names the obligation.
# [[feedback-no-rust-extension-shortcut]] — this species is a
#   shard-decl + spec + math triad; ZERO new Rust. The Reed follow-up
#   tick A adds ONE roomba composition-edge line; the empirical tick C
#   runs the compiler on itself and the compiler authors the deletion
