#   bytes removed per fixed-point iteration).
# [[feedback-cli-subcommand-nesting-is-geometric]] — species-under-
#   @kintsugi/fracture is geometric ground truth; this shard sits in
#   the same column as the fourteen landed siblings.
# [[feedback-legibility-over-foundation-when-collapsing]] — the shape
#   name `bilateral_arm_redundant` is the readable Alex-lineage word;
#   the foundational `shadow_arm_of_reflective_corpus_entry` alternate
